Error [E1305]: field `names` has no CLI flag mapping ([String])
  --> tests/ui/cli_field_unsupported_type.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     names: [String]
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: a `#[CLI]` field becomes one `--flag` (and a positional when required); only `Int`, `Float`, `Bool`, `String`, `Path`, and `T?` of those have a defined shape (nested `#[CLI]` structs and other collection/closure types don't).
 Fix: change the field to a supported type, or drop it from the `#[CLI]` struct
